===Noun===
{{examples|width=25%|examples=* ''Do you really think it is necessary?''
* ''Can't you do anything right?''
* ''Who could possibly believe that this treatment is just?''
* ''[[if someone told you to jump off a bridge, would you do it|If someone told you to jump off a bridge, would you do it]]?''
}}

{{en-noun}}

# A [[question]] posed only for dramatic or persuasive effect.
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} A question to which the asker does not expect an answer.
#: ''Are you nuts? Don't answer that – it's a '''rhetorical question'''.''

